## 6. Data Model

### 6.1 Conventions and constants (assumptions stated explicitly)

- **Units:** metres. Angles are in degrees at the API boundary and converted to radians once inside functions.
- **World axes:** right-handed ENU. X = East, Y = North, Z = Up. The ground plane is z = 0.
- **Azimuth:** degrees clockwise from North, 0–360. Elevation: degrees above the horizon.
- **Time:** local standard-time minutes since midnight (0–1439) plus a user-provided timezone offset in hours east of UTC. DST is not handled; the user types the offset in force.
- **Default site:** Lahore, lat 31.5204, lon 74.3587, tz +5.0. Default date 2024-03-21, default time 10:00.
